"Claim of Right to Possession and notice of Hearing | California Courts | Self Help Guide (https://selfhelp.courts.ca.gov/jcc-form/CP10)\nciteturn1628search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; # Claim of Right to Possession and notice of Hearing (CP10)Posted by a sheriff on a home along with a Notice to Vacate at the end of an eviction court case.\n\n# Claim of Right to Possession and notice of Hearing (CP10)\n\nPosted by a sheriff on a home along with a Notice to Vacate at the end of an eviction court case. Gives people who live in the home but weren’t a part of the case a chance to add themselves into the case to say why they shouldn’t be evicted.\n\nGet form CP10\n\nEffective: July 1, 2017\n\n  * Go to How-to instructions for Eviction--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nStatutory Forms | Judicial Branch of California (https://courts.ca.gov/forms-rules/court-forms/statutory-forms)\nciteturn1628search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; ## Court Forms ... CP10  | 2015  | Claim of Right to Possession and Notice of Hearing ... Trouble viewing a file?\n\n# Statutory Forms\n\n[Input]\n\n## Court Forms\n\n  * Using Forms\n  * Latest Changes\n  * Statutory Forms\n  * Appellate Claim Form\n\nThe forms below are provided for by the Legislature in statutes and are made available by the Judicial Council. Please refer to each form to locate the relevant statute for more information. \n\nForm  | Year  | Description\n--- | --- | ---\nCP10  | 2015  | Claim of Right to Possession and Notice of Hearing\nCP10.5  | 2015  | Prejudgment Claim of Right to Possession\nBOF 1022  | 2026  | Prohibited Persons Relinquishment Form (rev. 01/26)\nBOF 1022 S  | 2024  | Prohibited Persons Relinquishment Form (rev. 7/24) (Spanish)\nBOF 1023  | 2026  | Prohibited Person Firearm Information (rev. 01/26)\nBOF 1024  | 2024  | Designee Firearm Relinquishment Information\nBOF 1025  | 2024  | Firearm Disposition Receipt (rev. 7/24)\nBOF 1026  | 2026  | Probatio